{{ define "content" }}
<div class="prose">
  <h1>Not found</h1>
  <p>This site publishes the documentation of one <code>awa</code> release and nothing else. There are no
    versioned copies of older pages, so a link to a document a previous release included has no address here.</p>
  <p>If you already have <code>awa</code> installed, <code>awa help topics</code> lists the operational topics of
    the version you are running, without a network.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ .Site.DocsURL }}">All documentation</a>
    <a class="button" href="{{ .Site.HomeURL }}">Home</a>
  </div>
</div>
{{ end }}
